'''Commander Nyandam''' (武将ニャンダム, ''Bushō Nyandamu'', '''Commander Nyandam''') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] variant of [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] introduced in 12th Anniversary stages. He was added in [[Version 14.0 Update|Version 14.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Commander Nyandam
|image = E 704.png
|first appearance = [[The Red General (Normal)]]
|money drop = 6,000¢ - 23,700¢
}}

==Enemy==
A Dark Emperor Nyandam wearing a crown and holding a [[wikipedia:Gunbai|Gunbai]]. The demon heads on his throne look more dog-like, and his minions wear [[wikipedia:Kasa (hat)|Kasa]] and are holding spears.

==Strategy==
This variant of Nyandam still isn't very threatening, as he retains the long attack animation of his other variants, and his attacks are too slow for his 100% knockback to matter.

